      "value": "It seems lieke supersampling set too high will make more chance cause this framedrop issue, btw have you enabled VRSS in nvidia control panel? it might cause issue also.\nThe ram utilization still the same as before at my side, but of you doubt it has issue you can stay for more long time and see if the utilization grow over time (avatar data always can't be clear until switch instance) .",
